{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired to Fall</strong> is a puzzle-platformer where you <strong>collect</strong>, <strong>launch</strong>, and transform <strong>buddy-leaves</strong> into platforms to help a little leaf climb back to its tree. <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>glide</strong> and <strong>solve puzzles</strong> in an undergrowth packed with spiky chestnuts, acorns, and cannon-mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/34b44b1a218e8d4504af9bbfc67bee25.poster.avif?t=1755657063\" width=600 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/34b44b1a218e8d4504af9bbfc67bee25.webm?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/34b44b1a218e8d4504af9bbfc67bee25.mp4?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect</strong> different <strong>buddy-leaves</strong> along your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/629e55d9bf59548878e3d0034918a736.poster.avif?t=1755657063\" width=600 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/629e55d9bf59548878e3d0034918a736.webm?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/629e55d9bf59548878e3d0034918a736.mp4?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Launch</strong>, <strong>plant</strong>, and use <strong>buddy-leaves</strong> as platforms to overcome obstacles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/b65765f5b09f18a1d36f580b6680c6ab.poster.avif?t=1755657063\" width=600 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/b65765f5b09f18a1d36f580b6680c6ab.webm?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/extras/b65765f5b09f18a1d36f580b6680c6ab.mp4?t=1755657063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Glide</strong> and <strong>solve puzzles</strong> in a vibrant undergrowth filled with spiky chestnuts, acorns, and cannon-mushrooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play through 40+ handcrafted levels.<br></li><li>Explore all four seasons as you climb to the top of four majestic trees.<br></li><li>Enjoy cozy graphics and a soothing soundtrack.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397980?t=1755657063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397980?t=1755657063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/2192d41ee07e63497f98416384fa8e13de3fd52c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755657063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397980/2192d41ee07e63497f98416384fa8e13de3fd52c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755657063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3468620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired to Fall</strong> is a puzzle-platformer where you <strong>collect</strong>, <strong>launch</strong>, and transform <strong>